OL,3,GNEWSATeacher who pushed pupil and swore
OL,4,Ais banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA maths teacher has been barred from
OL,7,Fteaching after he was found to have
OL,8,Fgrabbed a pupil and pushed him up
OL,9,Fagainst a wall during an altercation at
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FChristopher Clarkson had taught at The
OL,13,Fde Ferrers Academy in
OL,14,FBurton-upon-Trent, Staffordshire, since
OL,15,FSeptember 2020.
OL,17,FA professional conduct panel viewed
OL,18,FCCTV footage and heard from witnesses
OL,19,Fabout the incident in October 2024.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
